      "writtenOn": "2026-08-11T02:49:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This board is mainly used to expose leak sensors. We did not define them in https://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/master/configurations/meta/ventura2/ventura2_canbus.json in order to maintain consistency with the legacy one, so that both configs expose to the same D-Bus and Redfish paths.",
      "parentUuid": "cb87e12f_93f09baa",
      "revId": "07589a1f72a4f105d2e500e8a1f415a050adc971",
