      "message": "\u003e For RMCv2 SKU1 / SKU1c, we install miniSAS boards (Legacy).\n\u003e For RMCv2 SKU4 / SKU4c, we install CAN Bus board.\n\nDoes these different boards show up in inventory depending on the SKU type ?",
